flowchart LR
subgraph Platform[サービス基盤 / 子が3つ]
 direction LR
 subgraph Web[Web / LR]
  direction LR
  gateway[受付API] --> auth[認証]
 end
 subgraph Workers[処理 / 内部もグリッド]
  direction TB
  subgraph Fast[即時処理 / TB]
   direction TB
   validate[検証] --> execute[実行]
  end
  subgraph Batch[バッチ / LR]
   direction LR
   aggregate[集計] --> report[レポート]
  end
  subgraph Retry[再試行 / TB]
   direction TB
   retry[再試行ワーカー]
  end
 end
 subgraph Data[データ / 横2列]
  direction LR
  db[(業務DB)] --> archive[(アーカイブ)]
 end
end
subgraph External[外部サービス / TB]
 direction TB
 payment[決済] --> receipt[通知]
end
auth --> validate
execute --> db
retry --> execute
report --> archive
gateway --> payment
receipt --> retry
